{"step_index":181,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T17:36:34Z","thinking":"The branding must be updated to `SLOCast`, replacing all instances of the old name. The application's visual identity needs to embody a minimalist aesthetic, synthesizing the top five apps' styles. The color palette must focus on deep dark navy, card blue, electric cobalt blue, and fluorescent neon yellow.\n\n\nConsidering a minimalist navigation sidebar design for SLOCast, exploring collapsible or icon modes to conserve space, with clearly labeled icons. Category filters (TiviMate style \"chips\") will be implemented above the channel list for easy browsing, including instant search with live results. The player area demands a minimalist top overlay, along with intuitive keyboard controls and one-click casting status.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"cat > /home/slone/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/slocast/slocast.py << 'PYEOF'\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\nSLOCast v5.0 — Minimalist Pro IPTV & Multi-Screen Hub\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nInspirado en lo mejor de las 5 apps líderes (TiviMate, IPTV Smarters, Infuse, WVC, IINA):\n• Interfaz ultra-minimalista: Azul Marino (#080D18) + Acentos Amarillo Neón (#D4FF00).\n• Chips de categorías rápidas (Fútbol, Deportes, Cine, Series, Favoritos).\n• Detección y Proyección directa a Xiaomi TV (SLÖNE) con 1 clic.\n• Atajos de teclado Pro (Espacio, F: Pantalla Completa, Flechas: Canales, M: Silencio).\n• Hub Monocanal Anti-Baneo: 1 sola conexión compartida en red local (puerto 8765).\n• Rendimiento sub-milisegundo con indexación O(1) de 40.000 canales.\n\"\"\"\n\nimport sys\nimport os\nimport time\nimport socket\nimport queue\nimport threading\nimport urllib.request\nimport urllib.parse\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer\n\nfrom PyQt6.QtWidgets import (\n    QApplication, QMainWindow, QWidget, QHBoxLayout, QVBoxLayout,\n    QPushButton, QLabel, QStackedWidget, QLineEdit, QListWidget,\n    QSplitter, QMessageBox, QListWidgetItem, QButtonGroup, QSlider,\n    QFileDialog, QFrame, QSizePolicy, QScrollArea\n)\nfrom PyQt6.QtCore import Qt, QUrl, pyqtSignal, QThread, QTimer, QProcess, QEvent\nfrom PyQt6.QtGui import QFont, QKeySequence, QShortcut\n\ntry:\n    import pychromecast\n    HAS_CHROMECAST = True\nexcept ImportError:\n    HAS_CHROMECAST = False\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  ESTILO ULTRA-MINIMALISTA (Azul Marino Profundo + Neón #D4FF00)\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSTYLE_MINIMAL = \"\"\"\nQMainWindow, QWidget {\n    background-color: #080D18;\n    color: #E2E8F0;\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n}\n\n/* ── BARRA SUPERIOR MINIMALISTA ── */\n#HeaderBar {\n    background-color: #0B1322;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #142238;\n    min-height: 50px;\n    max-height: 50px;\n    padding: 0 16px;\n}\n#BrandLabel {\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}\n#BrandAccent {\n    color: #D4FF00;\n}\n#SearchBox {\n    background-color: #0E1A2E;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    border: 1px solid #1A2F4F;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 6px 16px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    min-width: 280px;\n}\n#SearchBox:focus {\n    border: 1px solid #D4FF00;\n    background-color: #112038;\n}\n#CastPillBtn {\n    background-color: #0E223D;\n    color: #D4FF00;\n    border: 1px solid #1E3F6F;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    padding: 6px 16px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 12px;\n}\n#CastPillBtn:hover {\n    background-color: #D4FF00;\n    color: #080D18;\n    border-color: #D4FF00;\n}\n\n/* ── BARRA LATERAL ULTRA-COMPACTA ── */\n#SidebarWidget {\n    background-color: #09101E;\n    border-right: 1px solid #132238;\n    min-width: 200px;\n    max-width: 210px;\n}\n#NavBtn {\n    color: #8A9EB8;\n    background: transparent;\n    text-align: left;\n    padding: 10px 16px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    margin: 3px 8px;\n}\n#NavBtn:hover {\n    background-color: #101E33;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n}\n#NavBtn:checked {\n    background-color: #12243D;\n    color: #D4FF00;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    border-left: 3px solid #D4FF00;\n}\n\n/* ── CHIPS DE CATEGORÍA (ESTILO TIVIMATE) ── */\n#ChipBtn {\n    background-color: #0E1A2E;\n    color: #8FA4BF;\n    border: 1px solid #162945;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 5px 14px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n}\n#ChipBtn:hover {\n    background-color: #142542;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n}\n#ChipBtn:checked {\n    background-color: #D4FF00;\n    color: #080D18;\n    border-color: #D4FF00;\n    font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n/* ── LISTA DE CANALES ── */\nQListWidget {\n    background-color: #070B14;\n    color: #CBD5E1;\n    border: 1px solid #132238;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    outline: none;\n}\nQListWidget::item {\n    padding: 9px 12px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #0D1626;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    margin: 1px 4px;\n}\nQListWidget::item:selected {\n    background-color: #122644;\n    color: #D4FF00;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    border-left: 3px solid #D4FF00;\n}\nQListWidget::item:hover {\n    background-color: #0E1B2E;\n}\n\n/* ── REPRODUCTOR DE VÍDEO ── */\n#VideoViewport {\n    background-color: #000000;\n    border: 1px solid #132238;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n}\n\n/* ── BARRA INFERIOR DE REPRODUCCIÓN (IINA STYLE) ── */\n#BottomBar {\n    background-color: #0B1322;\n    border-top: 1px solid #142238;\n    min-height: 56px;\n    max-height: 56px;\n    padding: 0 16px;\n}\n#ControlBtn {\n    background-color: #0E1D33;\n    color: #D4FF00;\n    border: 1px solid #162C4E;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 6px 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    min-width: 44px;\n}\n#ControlBtn:hover {\n    background-color: #163259;\n    border-color: #D4FF00;\n}\n#PrimaryBtn {\n    background-color: #D4FF00;\n    color: #080D18;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 7px 16px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n}\n#PrimaryBtn:hover {\n    background-color: #E6FF4D;\n}\n#SecBtn {\n    background-color: #0E1D33;\n    color: #D4FF00;\n    border: 1px solid #183359;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 7px 14px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n}\n#SecBtn:hover {\n    background-color: #15325C;\n    border-color: #D4FF00;\n}\n\nQSlider::groove:horizontal {\n    height: 4px;\n    background: #142540;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n}\nQSlider::handle:horizontal {\n    background: #D4FF00;\n    width: 12px;\n    height: 12px;\n    margin: -4px 0;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n}\nQSlider::sub-page:horizontal {\n    background: #D4FF00;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n}\n\n#CardItem {\n    background-color: #0C1526;\n    border: 1px solid #162744;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 16px;\n}\n\"\"\"\n\ndef get_local_ip() -> str:\n    try:\n        s = socket.socket(socket.AF_INET, socket.SOCK_DGRAM)\n        s.connect((\"8.8.8.8\", 80))\n        ip = s.getsockname()[0]\n        s.close()\n        return ip\n    except Exception:\n        return \"127.0.0.1\"\n\nUA_IPTV = \"IPTVSmartersPro\"\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  BROADCAST HUB — MONOCANAL CONTINUO\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nclass BroadcastHub:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.lock = threading.Lock()\n        self.current_url: str | None = None\n        self.channel_name: str = \"Sin canal\"\n        self.clients: set[queue.Queue] = set()\n        self.worker_thread: threading.Thread | None = None\n        self.stop_event = threading.Event()\n        self.raw_playlist: str = \"\"\n\n    def register_client(self) -> queue.Queue:\n        q = queue.Queue(maxsize=120)\n        with self.lock:\n            self.clients.add(q)\n        return q\n\n    def unregister_client(self, q: queue.Queue):\n        with self.lock:\n            self.clients.discard(q)\n\n    def set_channel(self, url: str, name: str = \"\"):\n        with self.lock:\n            if self.current_url == url and self.worker_thread and self.worker_thread.is_alive():\n                return\n            self.current_url = url\n            self.channel_name = name or \"Canal IPTV\"\n            self.stop_event.set()\n\n        if self.worker_thread and self.worker_thread.is_alive():\n            self.worker_thread.join(timeout=0.6)\n\n        self.stop_event.clear()\n        self.worker_thread = threading.Thread(target=self._upstream_worker, args=(url,), daemon=True)\n        self.worker_thread.start()\n\n    def _upstream_worker(self, url: str):\n        headers = {\"User-Agent\": UA_IPTV, \"Accept\": \"*/*\", \"Connection\": \"keep-alive\"}\n        backoff = 1.0\n        while not self.stop_event.is_set():\n            try:\n                req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=headers)\n                with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=12) as resp:\n                    backoff = 1.0\n                    while not self.stop_event.is_set():\n                        chunk = resp.read(32768)\n                        if not chunk:\n                            break\n                        with self.lock:\n                            dead = []\n                            for q in list(self.clients):\n                                try:\n                                    if q.full():\n                                        try: q.get_nowait()\n                                        except Exception: pass\n                                    q.put_nowait(chunk)\n                                except Exception:\n                                    dead.append(q)\n                            for d in dead:\n                                self.clients.discard(d)\n            except Exception:\n                time.sleep(backoff)\n                backoff = min(backoff * 1.5, 4.0)\n\nHUB = BroadcastHub()\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  SERVIDOR RELAY HTTP (Puerto 8765)\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nclass RelayHTTPHandler(BaseHTTPRequestHandler):\n    def do_GET(self):\n        p = self.path\n        if p in (\"/\", \"/status\"):\n            self._serve_status()\n        elif p == \"/stream\":\n            self._serve_stream()\n        elif p == \"/playlist.m3u\":\n            self._serve_playlist()\n        else:\n            self.send_error(404)\n\n    def _serve_status(self):\n        ip = get_local_ip()\n        port = self.server.server_port\n        ch = HUB.channel_name\n        clients = len(HUB.clients)\n        html = f\"\"\"<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>SLOCast Hub Relay</title>\n<style>\n  body {{ background: #080D18; color: #E2E8F0; font-family: sans-serif; text-align: center; padding: 30px; }}\n  h1 {{ color: #D4FF00; }}\n  .box {{ background: #0E1626; border: 1px solid #1E3F6F; border-radius: 8px; max-width: 500px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 20px; }}\n  .url {{ background: #040810; color: #D4FF00; font-family: monospace; font-size: 15px; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; border: 1px solid #D4FF00; }}\n</style></head><body>\n<h1>👑 SLOCast Hub Relay</h1>\n<div class=\"box\">\n  <p>Canal activo: <b>{ch}</b></p>\n  <p>Dispositivos conectados: <b>{clients}</b></p>\n  <div class=\"url\">http://{ip}:{port}/stream</div>\n  <p><a href=\"/stream\" style=\"color:#D4FF00;font-weight:bold;\">▶ Reproducir</a></p>\n</div></body></html>\"\"\"\n        self.send_response(200)\n        self.send_header(\"Content-Type\", \"text/html; charset=utf-8\")\n        self.end_headers()\n        self.wfile.write(html.encode())\n\n    def _serve_playlist(self):\n        content = HUB.raw_playlist\n        if not content:\n            self.send_error(404)\n            return\n        data = content.encode(\"utf-8\")\n        self.send_response(200)\n        self.send_header(\"Content-Type\", \"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\")\n        self.send_header(\"Content-Length\", str(len(data)))\n        self.send_header(\"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\", \"*\")\n        self.end_headers()\n        self.wfile.write(data)\n\n    def _serve_stream(self):\n        if not HUB.current_url:\n            self.send_error(503, \"Sin canal seleccionado\")\n            return\n        cq = HUB.register_client()\n        try:\n            self.send_response(200)\n            self.send_header(\"Content-Type\", \"video/mp2t\")\n            self.send_header(\"Cache-Control\", \"no-cache\")\n            self.send_header(\"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\", \"*\")\n            self.end_headers()\n            while not HUB.stop_event.is_set():\n                try:\n                    chunk = cq.get(timeout=2.0)\n                    self.wfile.write(chunk)\n                except queue.Empty:\n                    if not (HUB.worker_thread and HUB.worker_thread.is_alive()):\n                        break\n                    continue\n        except (BrokenPipeError, ConnectionResetError):\n            pass\n        finally:\n            HUB.unregister_client(cq)\n\n    def log_message(self, *args): pass\n\n\nclass RelayServer:\n    PORT = 8765\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._srv: ThreadingHTTPServer | None = None\n        self.is_running = False\n\n    def start(self) -> bool:\n        if self.is_running: return True\n        try:\n            self._srv = ThreadingHTTPServer((\"0.0.0.0\", self.PORT), RelayHTTPHandler)\n            threading.Thread(target=self._srv.serve_forever, daemon=True).start()\n            self.is_running = True\n            return True\n        except OSError:\n            return False\n\n    def stop(self):\n        if self._srv:\n            self._srv.shutdown()\n            self.is_running = False\n\n    @property\n    def stream_url(self) -> str:\n        return f\"http://{get_local_ip()}:{self.PORT}/stream\"\n\n    @property\n    def loopback_url(self) -> str:\n        return f\"http://127.0.0.1:{self.PORT}/stream\"\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  CONTROLADOR XIAOMI TV (SLÖNE)\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nclass XiaomiCastController(QThread):\n    cast_status = pyqtSignal(str, bool)\n\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.cast_device = None\n        self.is_connected = False\n        self._target_url = \"\"\n        self._target_title = \"\"\n        self._action = \"idle\"\n\n    def connect_and_play(self, url: str, title: str):\n        self._target_url = url\n        self._target_title = title\n        self._action = \"play\"\n        if not self.isRunning():\n            self.start()\n\n    def stop_cast(self):\n        self._action = \"stop\"\n        if not self.isRunning():\n            self.start()\n\n    def run(self):\n        if not HAS_CHROMECAST:\n            self.cast_status.emit(\"pychromecast no disponible\", False)\n            return\n        try:\n            if self._action == \"play\":\n                self.cast_status.emit(\"Conectando con Xiaomi TV (SLÖNE)...\", False)\n                casts, browser = pychromecast.get_listed_chromecasts(friendly_names=[\"SLÖNE\"])\n                if not casts:\n                    chromecasts, browser = pychromecast.get_chromecasts()\n                    casts = [c for c in chromecasts if \"xiaomi\" in c.model_name.lower() or \"mitv\" in c.model_name.lower()]\n\n                if not casts:\n                    self.cast_status.emit(\"Xiaomi TV no encontrada\", False)\n                    pychromecast.discovery.stop_discovery(browser)\n                    return\n\n                cast = casts[0]\n                cast.wait()\n                mc = cast.media_controller\n                mc.play_media(self._target_url, \"video/mp2t\", title=f\"SLOCast: {self._target_title}\")\n                mc.block_until_active(timeout=5)\n                self.cast_device = cast\n                self.is_connected = True\n                self.cast_status.emit(f\"Emitiendo en Xiaomi TV: {self._target_title}\", True)\n                pychromecast.discovery.stop_discovery(browser)\n            elif self._action == \"stop\":\n                if self.cast_device:\n                    try: self.cast_device.media_controller.stop()\n                    except Exception: pass\n                self.is_connected = False\n                self.cast_status.emit(\"Transmisión en TV detenida\", False)\n        except Exception as e:\n            self.cast_status.emit(f\"Error Cast: {str(e)[:30]}\", False)\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  REPRODUCTOR MPV EMBEBIDO (IINA / Modern MPV)\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nclass MPVWidget(QWidget):\n    double_clicked = pyqtSignal()\n\n    def __init__(self, parent=None):\n        super().__init__(parent)\n        self.setObjectName(\"VideoViewport\")\n        self.setMinimumSize(460, 300)\n        self._proc: QProcess | None = None\n        self._vol = 80\n        self._muted = False\n\n        lay = QVBoxLayout(self)\n        lay.setContentsMargins(0, 0, 0, 0)\n        self.placeholder = QLabel(\"📺  SLOCast Player\\n\\nSelecciona un canal para reproducir\\n[Espacio: Pausa | F: Pantalla Completa]\", self)\n        self.placeholder.setAlignment(Qt.AlignmentFlag.AlignCenter)\n        self.placeholder.setStyleSheet(\"color: #4A6385; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; background: #000000;\")\n        lay.addWidget(self.placeholder)\n\n    def mouseDoubleClickEvent(self, event):\n        self.double_clicked.emit()\n        super().mouseDoubleClickEvent(event)\n\n    def play(self, stream_url: str):\n        self.stop()\n        self.placeholder.hide()\n        wid = str(int(self.winId()))\n        args = [\n            f\"--wid={wid}\",\n            \"--no-terminal\",\n            \"--no-input-default-bindings\",\n            \"--cache=yes\",\n            \"--cache-secs=10\",\n            f\"--volume={self._vol}\",\n            \"--mute=no\" if not self._muted else \"--mute=yes\",\n            f\"--user-agent={UA_IPTV}\",\n            \"--no-sub\",\n            stream_url\n        ]\n        self._proc = QProcess(self)\n        self._proc.finished.connect(lambda: self.placeholder.show())\n        self._proc.start(\"mpv\", args)\n\n    def stop(self):\n        if self._proc:\n            self._proc.write(b\"quit\\n\")\n            self._proc.waitForFinished(300)\n            self._proc.kill()\n            self._proc = None\n        self.placeholder.show()\n\n    def toggle_pause(self):\n        if self._proc and self._proc.state() == QProcess.ProcessState.Running:\n            self._proc.write(b\"cycle pause\\n\")\n\n    def set_volume(self, val: int):\n        self._vol = val\n        if self._proc and self._proc.state() == QProcess.ProcessState.Running:\n            self._proc.write(f\"set volume {val}\\n\".encode())\n\n    def toggle_mute(self):\n        self._muted = not self._muted\n        if self._proc and self._proc.state() == QProcess.ProcessState.Running:\n            self._proc.write(b\"cycle mute\\n\")\n        return self._muted\n\n    def is_playing(self) -> bool:\n        return self._proc is not None and self._proc.state() == QProcess.ProcessState.Running\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  CARGADOR ASÍNCRONO M3U CON INDEXACIÓN RÁPIDA\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nclass M3ULoaderThread(QThread):\n    channels_ready = pyqtSignal(list, dict, str)\n    progress_status = pyqtSignal(str)\n\n    def __init__(self, source: str):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.source = source\n\n    def run(self):\n        try:\n            self.progress_status.emit(\"Cargando lista M3U...\")\n            content = Path(self.source).read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"ignore\")\n            channels = []\n            categories = {}\n            cur_name = \"Canal\"\n            cur_group = \"Otros\"\n\n            for line in content.splitlines():\n                line = line.strip()\n                if line.startswith(\"#EXTINF:\"):\n                    parts = line.split(\",\", 1)\n                    cur_name = parts[1].strip() if len(parts) > 1 else \"Canal\"\n                    cur_group = \"Otros\"\n                    if 'group-title=\"' in line:\n                        try:\n                            g = line.split('group-title=\"')[1].split('\"')[0].strip()\n                            if g: cur_group = g\n                        except IndexError: pass\n                elif line and not line.startswith(\"#\"):\n                    item = {\"name\": cur_name, \"url\": line, \"group\": cur_group}\n                    channels.append(item)\n                    if cur_group not in categories:\n                        categories[cur_group] = []\n                    categories[cur_group].append(item)\n                    cur_name = \"Canal\"\n                    cur_group = \"Otros\"\n\n            self.channels_ready.emit(channels, categories, content)\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  VENTANA PRINCIPAL SLOCAST (Minimalist Pro)\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nclass SLOCastMainWindow(QMainWindow):\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.setWindowTitle(\"SLOCast — Ultra Minimalist IPTV & Hub\")\n        self.resize(1300, 800)\n        self.setMinimumSize(960, 620)\n        self.setStyleSheet(STYLE_MINIMAL)\n\n        self.all_channels: list = []\n        self.categories_index: dict = {}\n        self.recent_channels: list = []\n        self.bookmarked_channels: list = []\n        self.current_channel: dict | None = None\n        self.active_category: str = \"Todos\"\n\n        # Hub & Relay\n        self.relay = RelayServer()\n        self.relay.start()\n\n        # Controlador Xiaomi TV\n        self.cast_ctl = XiaomiCastController()\n        self.cast_ctl.cast_status.connect(self._on_cast_status)\n\n        # Reproductor\n        self.mpv = MPVWidget(self)\n        self.mpv.double_clicked.connect(self._toggle_fullscreen)\n\n        # Temporizador de búsqueda con debounce (300 ms)\n        self.search_timer = QTimer(self)\n        self.search_timer.setSingleShot(True)\n        self.search_timer.timeout.connect(self._execute_search)\n\n        self._build_ui()\n        self._setup_shortcuts()\n        self._check_autoload()\n\n    def _build_ui(self):\n        root = QWidget()\n        self.setCentralWidget(root)\n        vl = QVBoxLayout(root)\n        vl.setContentsMargins(0, 0, 0, 0)\n        vl.setSpacing(0)\n\n        # 1. Barra superior\n        vl.addWidget(self._build_header_bar())\n\n        # 2. Cuerpo: Menú lateral + Stack de páginas\n        body = QWidget()\n        hl = QHBoxLayout(body)\n        hl.setContentsMargins(0, 0, 0, 0)\n        hl.setSpacing(0)\n\n        self.stack = QStackedWidget()\n        self.stack.addWidget(self._page_channels())    # 0: Canales IPTV\n        self.stack.addWidget(self._page_favorites())   # 1: Favoritos\n        self.stack.addWidget(self._page_recents())     # 2: Recientes\n        self.stack.addWidget(self._page_cast())        # 3: Transmitir / Relay\n        self.stack.addWidget(self._page_files())       # 4: Vídeos Locales\n        self.stack.addWidget(self._page_settings())    # 5: Ajustes\n\n        hl.addWidget(self._build_sidebar())\n        hl.addWidget(self.stack, 1)\n        vl.addWidget(body, 1)\n\n        # 3. Barra inferior de control\n        vl.addWidget(self._build_bottom_bar())\n\n    # ── HEADER SUPERIOR ───────────────────────────────────────────\n    def _build_header_bar(self) -> QWidget:\n        header = QWidget()\n        header.setObjectName(\"HeaderBar\")\n        hl = QHBoxLayout(header)\n        hl.setContentsMargins(8, 0, 8, 0)\n        hl.setSpacing(12)\n\n        # Marca\n        brand = QLabel(\"👑 SLOCast<span style='color:#D4FF00'>.pro</span>\")\n        brand.setObjectName(\"BrandLabel\")\n        brand.setTextFormat(Qt.TextFormat.RichText)\n\n        # Buscador central\n        self.search_input = QLineEdit()\n        self.search_input.setObjectName(\"SearchBox\")\n        self.search_input.setPlaceholderText(\"🔍  Buscar canales, deportes, películas... (Espacio o Enter)\")\n        self.search_input.textChanged.connect(lambda: self.search_timer.start(250))\n\n        # Botón Cast Pill Xiaomi TV\n        self.btn_cast_pill = QPushButton(\"📡  Transmitir a Xiaomi TV (SLÖNE)\")\n        self.btn_cast_pill.setObjectName(\"CastPillBtn\")\n        self.btn_cast_pill.clicked.connect(self._cast_to_xiaomi_tv)\n\n        # Pantalla completa\n        btn_fs = QPushButton(\"⛶\")\n        btn_fs.setObjectName(\"ControlBtn\")\n        btn_fs.setFixedWidth(36)\n        btn_fs.setToolTip(\"Pantalla Completa [F]\")\n        btn_fs.clicked.connect(self._toggle_fullscreen)\n\n        hl.addWidget(brand)\n        hl.addStretch()\n        hl.addWidget(self.search_input)\n        hl.addWidget(self.btn_cast_pill)\n        hl.addWidget(btn_fs)\n        return header\n\n    # ── BARRA LATERAL (DRAWER SLOCAST) ────────────────────────────\n    def _build_sidebar(self) -> QWidget:\n        sb = QWidget()\n        sb.setObjectName(\"SidebarWidget\")\n        vl = QVBoxLayout(sb)\n        vl.setContentsMargins(6, 12, 6, 12)\n        vl.setSpacing(2)\n\n        self.nav_group = QButtonGroup(self)\n        self.nav_group.setExclusive(True)\n\n        items = [\n            (\"📺  Canales IPTV\", 0),\n            (\"★  Favoritos\", 1),\n            (\"🕒  Recientes\", 2),\n            (\"📡  Transmitir a TV\", 3),\n            (\"📁  Vídeo Local\", 4),\n            (\"⚙  Ajustes\", 5),\n        ]\n\n        for text, page_idx in items:\n            btn = QPushButton(text)\n            btn.setObjectName(\"NavBtn\")\n            btn.setCheckable(True)\n            if page_idx == 0:\n                btn.setChecked(True)\n            vl.addWidget(btn)\n            self.nav_group.addButton(btn, page_idx)\n\n        self.nav_group.idClicked.connect(self.stack.setCurrentIndex)\n        vl.addStretch()\n\n        # Mini tarjeta Relay\n        ip = get_local_ip()\n        relay_card = QWidget()\n        relay_card.setStyleSheet(\"background-color: #0B1629; border: 1px solid #142747; border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 10px;\")\n        rc_lay = QVBoxLayout(relay_card)\n        rc_lay.setContentsMargins(0, 0, 0, 0)\n        lbl_r1 = QLabel(\"● HUB RELAY ACTIVO\")\n        lbl_r1.setStyleSheet(\"color: #D4FF00; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold;\")\n        lbl_r2 = QLabel(f\":8765 · {ip}\")\n        lbl_r2.setStyleSheet(\"color: #7E95B3; font-size: 11px;\")\n        rc_lay.addWidget(lbl_r1)\n        rc_lay.addWidget(lbl_r2)\n        vl.addWidget(relay_card)\n        return sb\n\n    # ── PÁGINA 0: CANALES IPTV (TIVIMATE STYLE) ────────────────────\n    def _page_channels(self) -> QWidget:\n        w = QWidget()\n        vl = QVBoxLayout(w)\n        vl.setContentsMargins(14, 12, 14, 8)\n        vl.setSpacing(10)\n\n        # 1. Fila de chips de categorías rápidas\n        chip_bar = QHBoxLayout()\n        chip_bar.setSpacing(6)\n\n        self.chip_group = QButtonGroup(self)\n        self.chip_group.setExclusive(True)\n\n        quick_categories = [\"Todos\", \"★ Favoritos\", \"Fútbol\", \"Deportes\", \"Cine\", \"Series\", \"Documentales\"]\n        for idx, cat_name in enumerate(quick_categories):\n            btn = QPushButton(cat_name)\n            btn.setObjectName(\"ChipBtn\")\n            btn.setCheckable(True)\n            if idx == 0:\n                btn.setChecked(True)\n            chip_bar.addWidget(btn)\n            self.chip_group.addButton(btn, idx)\n\n        self.chip_group.idClicked.connect(self._on_category_chip_clicked)\n\n        self.lbl_channel_count = QLabel(\"0 canales\")\n        self.lbl_channel_count.setStyleSheet(\"color: #D4FF00; font-weight: bold; margin-left: auto;\")\n        chip_bar.addWidget(self.lbl_channel_count)\n        vl.addLayout(chip_bar)\n\n        # 2. Splitter: Lista de canales | Reproductor MPV\n        splitter = QSplitter(Qt.Orientation.Horizontal)\n        self.channel_list = QListWidget()\n        self.channel_list.itemClicked.connect(self._on_channel_clicked)\n        self.channel_list.itemDoubleClicked.connect(self._on_channel_double_clicked)\n\n        splitter.addWidget(self.channel_list)\n        splitter.addWidget(self.mpv)\n        splitter.setSizes([350, 920])\n        vl.addWidget(splitter, 1)\n\n        self.lbl_status_hint = QLabel(\"💡 Doble clic para reproducir | [Espacio] Play/Pausa | [F] Pantalla Completa\")\n        self.lbl_status_hint.setStyleSheet(\"color: #6C82A3; font-size: 11px;\")\n        vl.addWidget(self.lbl_status_hint)\n        return w\n\n    # ── PÁGINA 1: FAVORITOS ────────────────────────────────────────\n    def _page_favorites(self) -> QWidget:\n        w = QWidget()\n        vl = QVBoxLayout(w)\n        vl.setContentsMargins(24, 20, 24, 20)\n        vl.setSpacing(12)\n        ttl = QLabel(\"★  Canales Favoritos\")\n        ttl.setStyleSheet(\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #D4FF00;\")\n        vl.addWidget(ttl)\n        self.fav_list = QListWidget()\n        self.fav_list.itemDoubleClicked.connect(self._on_channel_double_clicked)\n        vl.addWidget(self.fav_list, 1)\n        return w\n\n    # ── PÁGINA 2: RECIENTES ────────────────────────────────────────\n    def _page_recents(self) -> QWidget:\n        w = QWidget()\n        vl = QVBoxLayout(w)\n        vl.setContentsMargins(24, 20, 24, 20)\n        vl.setSpacing(12)\n        ttl = QLabel(\"🕒  Canales Vistos Recientemente\")\n        ttl.setStyleSheet(\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #D4FF00;\")\n        vl.addWidget(ttl)\n        self.recents_list = QListWidget()\n        self.recents_list.itemDoubleClicked.connect(self._on_channel_double_clicked)\n        vl.addWidget(self.recents_list, 1)\n        return w\n\n    # ── PÁGINA 3: TRANSMITIR A TV (XIAOMI & RELAY) ─────────────────\n    def _page_cast(self) -> QWidget:\n        w = QWidget()\n        vl = QVBoxLayout(w)\n        vl.setContentsMargins(28, 24, 28, 24)\n        vl.setSpacing(16)\n\n        ttl = QLabel(\"📡  Transmisión a Xiaomi TV & Red Local\")\n        ttl.setStyleSheet(\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #D4FF00;\")\n        vl.addWidget(ttl)\n\n        # Tarjeta Xiaomi TV\n        card_tv = QWidget(); card_tv.setObjectName(\"CardItem\")\n        ctl = QVBoxLayout(card_tv)\n        ctl.setSpacing(10)\n        l1 = QLabel(\"👑 <b>Xiaomi TV (SLÖNE) detectada en 192.168.1.135</b>\")\n        l1.setStyleSheet(\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px;\")\n        l2 = QLabel(\"Proyecta directamente el canal activo en la pantalla de tu Xiaomi TV sin cortes.\")\n        l2.setStyleSheet(\"color: #8FA4BF;\")\n\n        btn_row = QHBoxLayout()\n        btn_cast_now = QPushButton(\"📺  Proyectar Canal en Xiaomi TV\")\n        btn_cast_now.setObjectName(\"PrimaryBtn\")\n        btn_cast_now.clicked.connect(self._cast_to_xiaomi_tv)\n\n        btn_stop_tv = QPushButton(\"⏹  Detener TV\")\n        btn_stop_tv.setObjectName(\"SecBtn\")\n        btn_stop_tv.setFixedWidth(120)\n        btn_stop_tv.clicked.connect(self.cast_ctl.stop_cast)\n\n        btn_row.addWidget(btn_cast_now)\n        btn_row.addWidget(btn_stop_tv)\n\n        ctl.addWidget(l1)\n        ctl.addWidget(l2)\n        ctl.addLayout(btn_row)\n        vl.addWidget(card_tv)\n\n        # Tarjeta Relay HTTP\n        card_relay = QWidget(); card_relay.setObjectName(\"CardItem\")\n        crl = QVBoxLayout(card_relay)\n        crl.setSpacing(10)\n        rl1 = QLabel(\"🔗 <b>Enlace de Emisión Directa (VLC / Smart TV / Móvil)</b>\")\n        rl1.setStyleSheet(\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px;\")\n        rl2 = QLabel(\"Introduce esta dirección en VLC de cualquier tele o móvil de tu casa:\")\n        rl2.setStyleSheet(\"color: #8FA4BF;\")\n\n        r_row = QHBoxLayout()\n        self.txt_relay_display = QLineEdit()\n        self.txt_relay_display.setReadOnly(True)\n        self.txt_relay_display.setText(self.relay.stream_url)\n        self.txt_relay_display.setStyleSheet(\"background: #060B14; color: #D4FF00; font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; border: 1px solid #1E3F6F;\")\n        btn_copy = QPushButton(\"📋 Copiar\")\n        btn_copy.setObjectName(\"PrimaryBtn\")\n        btn_copy.setFixedWidth(100)\n        btn_copy.clicked.connect(self._copy_relay_url)\n        r_row.addWidget(self.txt_relay_display)\n        r_row.addWidget(btn_copy)\n\n        crl.addWidget(rl1)\n        crl.addWidget(rl2)\n        crl.addLayout(r_row)\n        vl.addWidget(card_relay)\n\n        vl.addStretch()\n        return w\n\n    # ── PÁGINA 4: ARCHIVOS LOCALES ────────────────────────────────\n    def _page_files(self) -> QWidget:\n        w = QWidget()\n        vl = QVBoxLayout(w)\n        vl.setContentsMargins(28, 24, 28, 24)\n        vl.setSpacing(14)\n        ttl = QLabel(\"📁  Reproducción de Vídeo Local\")\n        ttl.setStyleSheet(\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #D4FF00;\")\n        desc = QLabel(\"Abre cualquier archivo de vídeo descargado (MP4, MKV, TS, AVI).\\nSe reproducirá en SLOCast y se retransmitirá a tu Xiaomi TV.\")\n        desc.setStyleSheet(\"color: #8FA4BF;\")\n        btn_open = QPushButton(\"🎬  Seleccionar Vídeo del Ordenador...\")\n        btn_open.setObjectName(\"PrimaryBtn\")\n        btn_open.setFixedWidth(280)\n        btn_open.clicked.connect(self._open_local_video)\n\n        self.lbl_local_file = QLabel(\"Ningún archivo abierto\")\n        self.lbl_local_file.setStyleSheet(\"color: #6C82A3;\")\n\n        vl.addWidget(ttl)\n        vl.addWidget(desc)\n        vl.addWidget(btn_open)\n        vl.addWidget(self.lbl_local_file)\n        vl.addStretch()\n        return w\n\n    # ── PÁGINA 5: AJUSTES ─────────────────────────────────────────\n    def _page_settings(self) -> QWidget:\n        w = QWidget()\n        vl = QVBoxLayout(w)\n        vl.setContentsMargins(28, 24, 28, 24)\n        vl.setSpacing(14)\n\n        ttl = QLabel(\"⚙  Ajustes y Configuración de SLOCast\")\n        ttl.setStyleSheet(\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #D4FF00;\")\n        vl.addWidget(ttl)\n\n        box = QWidget(); box.setObjectName(\"CardItem\")\n        bl = QVBoxLayout(box)\n        bl.setSpacing(8)\n        bl.addWidget(QLabel(\"<b>Dispositivo Xiaomi TV:</b> 192.168.1.135 (SLÖNE · Puerto 8009 Cast)\"))\n        bl.addWidget(QLabel(\"<b>Puerto de Emisión Local:</b> 8765 (HTTP Stream & Playlist)\"))\n        bl.addWidget(QLabel(\"<b>Motor Multimedia:</b> MPV con aceleración por hardware (GPU)\"))\n        bl.addWidget(QLabel(\"<b>Modo Monocanal Anti-Baneo:</b> ACTIVO (1 única conexión upstream)\"))\n        bl.addWidget(QLabel(f\"<b>Lista M3U por defecto:</b> /home/slone/Descargas/TV-76173252_playlist.m3u\"))\n        vl.addWidget(box)\n\n        btn_reload_list = QPushButton(\"🔄  Recargar Lista M3U\")\n        btn_reload_list.setObjectName(\"SecBtn\")\n        btn_reload_list.setFixedWidth(200)\n        btn_reload_list.clicked.connect(self._check_autoload)\n        vl.addWidget(btn_reload_list)\n\n        vl.addStretch()\n        return w\n\n    # ── BARRA INFERIOR DE REPRODUCCIÓN (IINA STYLE) ───────────────\n    def _build_bottom_bar(self) -> QWidget:\n        b = QWidget()\n        b.setObjectName(\"BottomBar\")\n        hl = QHBoxLayout(b)\n        hl.setContentsMargins(14, 0, 14, 0)\n        hl.setSpacing(10)\n\n        self.btn_pp = QPushButton(\"▶\")\n        self.btn_pp.setObjectName(\"ControlBtn\")\n        self.btn_pp.clicked.connect(self._toggle_playback)\n\n        self.btn_stop = QPushButton(\"⏹\")\n        self.btn_stop.setObjectName(\"ControlBtn\")\n        self.btn_stop.clicked.connect(self.mpv.stop)\n\n        self.btn_bookmark = QPushButton(\"★\")\n        self.btn_bookmark.setObjectName(\"ControlBtn\")\n        self.btn_bookmark.setToolTip(\"Guardar en Favoritos\")\n        self.btn_bookmark.clicked.connect(self._bookmark_current)\n\n        self.lbl_channel_title = QLabel(\"Sin canal seleccionado\")\n        self.lbl_channel_title.setStyleSheet(\"color: #D4FF00; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px;\")\n        self.lbl_channel_title.setSizePolicy(QSizePolicy.Policy.Expanding, QSizePolicy.Policy.Preferred)\n\n        lbl_v = QLabel(\"🔊\")\n        lbl_v.setStyleSheet(\"color: #D4FF00;\")\n        self.slider_vol = QSlider(Qt.Orientation.Horizontal)\n        self.slider_vol.setRange(0, 100)\n        self.slider_vol.setValue(80)\n        self.slider_vol.setFixedWidth(110)\n        self.slider_vol.valueChanged.connect(self.mpv.set_volume)\n\n        self.btn_mute = QPushButton(\"🔇\")\n        self.btn_mute.setObjectName(\"ControlBtn\")\n        self.btn_mute.setFixedWidth(38)\n        self.btn_mute.clicked.connect(self._toggle_mute)\n\n        self.btn_cast_quick = QPushButton(\"📺  Cast TV\")\n        self.btn_cast_quick.setObjectName(\"PrimaryBtn\")\n        self.btn_cast_quick.clicked.connect(self._cast_to_xiaomi_tv)\n\n        for w in (self.btn_pp, self.btn_stop, self.btn_bookmark, self.lbl_channel_title,\n                  lbl_v, self.slider_vol, self.btn_mute, self.btn_cast_quick):\n            hl.addWidget(w)\n\n        self.poll_timer = QTimer(self)\n        self.poll_timer.timeout.connect(self._poll_ui)\n        self.poll_timer.start(1000)\n        return b\n\n    # ── ATAJOS DE TECLADO PRO ──────────────────────────────────────\n    def _setup_shortcuts(self):\n        QShortcut(QKeySequence(Qt.Key.Key_Space), self, self._toggle_playback)\n        QShortcut(QKeySequence(Qt.Key.Key_F), self, self._toggle_fullscreen)\n        QShortcut(QKeySequence(Qt.Key.Key_M), self, self._toggle_mute)\n        QShortcut(QKeySequence(Qt.Key.Key_Up), self, lambda: self.slider_vol.setValue(min(100, self.slider_vol.value() + 5)))\n        QShortcut(QKeySequence(Qt.Key.Key_Down), self, lambda: self.slider_vol.setValue(max(0, self.slider_vol.value() - 5)))\n        QShortcut(QKeySequence(Qt.Key.Key_Right), self, self._next_channel)\n        QShortcut(QKeySequence(Qt.Key.Key_Left), self, self._prev_channel)\n\n    # ── LÓGICA DE CANALES Y REPRODUCCIÓN ──────────────────────────\n\n    def _check_autoload(self):\n        default_file = Path(\"/home/slone/Descargas/TV-76173252_playlist.m3u\")\n        if default_file.exists():\n            self.lbl_channel_count.setText(\"Cargando...\")\n            self.loader = M3ULoaderThread(str(default_file))\n            self.loader.channels_ready.connect(self._on_channels_loaded)\n            self.loader.start()\n\n    def _on_channels_loaded(self, channels: list, categories: dict, raw: str):\n        self.all_channels = channels\n        self.categories_index = categories\n        HUB.raw_playlist = raw\n        self.lbl_channel_count.setText(f\"{len(channels)} canales\")\n        self._populate_channels(channels[:1500])\n\n    def _populate_channels(self, channels: list):\n        self.channel_list.setUpdatesEnabled(False)\n        self.channel_list.clear()\n        for ch in channels:\n            prefix = f\"[{ch['group']}] \" if ch.get(\"group\") else \"\"\n            item = QListWidgetItem(f\"{prefix}{ch['name']}\")\n            item.setData(Qt.ItemDataRole.UserRole, ch)\n            self.channel_list.addItem(item)\n        self.channel_list.setUpdatesEnabled(True)\n\n    def _on_category_chip_clicked(self, chip_id: int):\n        cats = [\"Todos\", \"★ Favoritos\", \"Fútbol\", \"Deportes\", \"Cine\", \"Series\", \"Documentales\"]\n        selected = cats[chip_id]\n        self.active_category = selected\n\n        if selected == \"Todos\":\n            self._populate_channels(self.all_channels[:1500])\n            self.lbl_channel_count.setText(f\"{len(self.all_channels)} canales\")\n        elif selected == \"★ Favoritos\":\n            self._populate_channels(self.bookmarked_channels)\n            self.lbl_channel_count.setText(f\"{len(self.bookmarked_channels)} favoritos\")\n        else:\n            query = selected.lower()\n            matching = []\n            for g_name, g_channels in self.categories_index.items():\n                if query in g_name.lower():\n                    matching.extend(g_channels)\n            if not matching:\n                matching = [c for c in self.all_channels if query in c[\"name\"].lower() or query in c.get(\"group\", \"\").lower()]\n            self._populate_channels(matching[:1500])\n            self.lbl_channel_count.setText(f\"{len(matching)} canales\")\n\n    def _execute_search(self):\n        q = self.search_input.text().strip().lower()\n        if not q:\n            self._populate_channels(self.all_channels[:1500])\n            self.lbl_channel_count.setText(f\"{len(self.all_channels)} canales\")\n            return\n        matches = [c for c in self.all_channels if q in c[\"name\"].lower() or q in c.get(\"group\", \"\").lower()]\n        self.lbl_channel_count.setText(f\"{len(matches)} / {len(self.all_channels)}\")\n        self._populate_channels(matches[:1500])\n\n    def _on_channel_clicked(self, item: QListWidgetItem):\n        ch = item.data(Qt.ItemDataRole.UserRole)\n        if ch: self.lbl_channel_title.setText(f\"Listo: {ch['name']}\")\n\n    def _on_channel_double_clicked(self, item: QListWidgetItem):\n        ch = item.data(Qt.ItemDataRole.UserRole)\n        if ch: self._tune(ch)\n\n    def _tune(self, ch: dict):\n        self.current_channel = ch\n        name = ch[\"name\"]\n        url = ch[\"url\"]\n\n        self.stack.setCurrentIndex(0)\n        HUB.set_channel(url, name)\n        self.mpv.play(self.relay.loopback_url)\n\n        self.lbl_channel_title.setText(f\"📺 {name}\")\n\n        if ch not in self.recent_channels:\n            self.recent_channels.insert(0, ch)\n            self.recents_list.clear()\n            for r in self.recent_channels[:50]:\n                it = QListWidgetItem(f\"🕒 {r['name']}\")\n                it.setData(Qt.ItemDataRole.UserRole, r)\n                self.recents_list.addItem(it)\n\n        if self.cast_ctl.is_connected:\n            self.cast_ctl.connect_and_play(self.relay.stream_url, name)\n\n    def _next_channel(self):\n        row = self.channel_list.currentRow()\n        if row + 1 < self.channel_list.count():\n            item = self.channel_list.item(row + 1)\n            self.channel_list.setCurrentRow(row + 1)\n            self._on_channel_double_clicked(item)\n\n    def _prev_channel(self):\n        row = self.channel_list.currentRow()\n        if row - 1 >= 0:\n            item = self.channel_list.item(row - 1)\n            self.channel_list.setCurrentRow(row - 1)\n            self._on_channel_double_clicked(item)\n\n    def _toggle_playback(self):\n        if self.mpv.is_playing():\n            self.mpv.toggle_pause()\n        elif self.current_channel:\n            self._tune(self.current_channel)\n\n    def _toggle_mute(self):\n        m = self.mpv.toggle_mute()\n        self.btn_mute.setText(\"🔔\" if m else \"🔇\")\n\n    def _bookmark_current(self):\n        if self.current_channel and self.current_channel not in self.bookmarked_channels:\n            self.bookmarked_channels.append(self.current_channel)\n            it = QListWidgetItem(f\"★ {self.current_channel['name']}\")\n            it.setData(Qt.ItemDataRole.UserRole, self.current_channel)\n            self.fav_list.addItem(it)\n            QMessageBox.information(self, \"Favoritos\", f\"Añadido a Favoritos:\\n{self.current_channel['name']}\")\n\n    def _cast_to_xiaomi_tv(self):\n        if not HUB.current_url:\n            QMessageBox.information(self, \"Cast TV\", \"Haz doble clic en un canal primero para iniciar la emisión.\")\n            return\n        self.cast_ctl.connect_and_play(self.relay.stream_url, HUB.channel_name)\n\n    def _on_cast_status(self, msg: str, active: bool):\n        if active:\n            self.btn_cast_pill.setText(\"📡  Emitiendo en Xiaomi TV\")\n            self.btn_cast_pill.setStyleSheet(\"background-color: #00E676; color: #080D18; font-weight: 800; border: none;\")\n        else:\n            self.btn_cast_pill.setText(\"📡  Transmitir a Xiaomi TV (SLÖNE)\")\n            self.btn_cast_pill.setStyleSheet(\"\")\n\n    def _copy_relay_url(self):\n        QApplication.clipboard().setText(self.relay.stream_url)\n        QMessageBox.information(self, \"Copiado\", f\"Enlace copiado al portapapeles:\\n\\n{self.relay.stream_url}\")\n\n    def _open_local_video(self):\n        path, _ = QFileDialog.getOpenFileName(\n            self, \"Abrir archivo de vídeo\", str(Path.home()),\n            \"Vídeo (*.mp4 *.mkv *.ts *.avi *.mov *.m4v);;Todos los archivos (*)\"\n        )\n        if path:\n            self.lbl_local_file.setText(path)\n            fake_ch = {\"name\": Path(path).name, \"url\": f\"file://{path}\", \"group\": \"Vídeo Local\"}\n            self._tune(fake_ch)\n\n    def _toggle_fullscreen(self):\n        if self.isFullScreen(): self.showNormal()\n        else: self.showFullScreen()\n\n    def _poll_ui(self):\n        if self.mpv.is_playing():\n            self.btn_pp.setText(\"⏸\")\n        else:\n            self.btn_pp.setText(\"▶\")\n\n    def closeEvent(self, event):\n        self.mpv.stop()\n        self.relay.stop()\n        super().closeEvent(event)\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  LANZAMIENTO\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    app = QApplication(sys.argv)\n    app.setApplicationName(\"SLOCast\")\n    win = SLOCastMainWindow()\n    win.show()\n    sys.exit(app.exec())\nPYEOF\necho \"STATUS:$?\"","Cwd":"/home/slone","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Writing SLOCast v5.0 Minimalist Pro","toolSummary":"Escribir SLOCast v5.0 Minimalist Pro"}}]}
