{"step_index":197,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T17:47:37Z","thinking":"The `slocast.py` design needs to implement a \"Deepest Pitch Black\" theme with specific color codes for panels and text. A mobile-optimized web remote control with an HTTP endpoint is required. The remote should have a responsive HTML/JS control panel.\n\n\nA mobile remote control interface is being designed, incorporating standard playback controls, a channel switcher leveraging API calls for immediate tuning. This mobile remote also features smart country and content filters for channel selection, as well as timeshift controls with configured MPV parameters. Additional functionality includes multi-audio, subtitle selection, and video deinterlacing options.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"cat > /home/slone/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/slocast/slocast.py << 'PYEOF'\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\nSLOCAST APEX v6.0 — The Ultimate Black & VR46 Neon IPTV & Hub Engine\n═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n• Branding VR46: Negro Absoluto (#000000) + Amarillo Neón Flúor (#E3FF00).\n• Web Remote Móvil (http://IP:8765/remote): Mando a distancia táctil para sofá.\n• Filtro Inteligente de Países: Selección con 1 clic de canales 🇪🇸 España y Deportes.\n• Timeshift & Pausa en Directo: Memoria caché de 256 MB para rebobinar fútbol en vivo.\n• Multi-Audio en Directo: Alterna audio oficial, radio (SER/COPE) o V.O. (Tecla A).\n• Desentrelazado Yadif Deportivo: Deportes a 50 FPS ultra-fluidos sin cortes.\n• Monocanal Anti-Baneo Upstream: 1 conexión al proveedor compartida con Xiaomi TV.\n\"\"\"\n\nimport sys\nimport os\nimport time\nimport socket\nimport queue\nimport threading\nimport urllib.request\nimport urllib.parse\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom http.server import BaseHTTPRequestHandler, ThreadingHTTPServer\n\nfrom PyQt6.QtWidgets import (\n    QApplication, QMainWindow, QWidget, QHBoxLayout, QVBoxLayout,\n    QPushButton, QLabel, QStackedWidget, QLineEdit, QListWidget,\n    QSplitter, QMessageBox, QListWidgetItem, QButtonGroup, QSlider,\n    QFileDialog, QFrame, QSizePolicy, QDialog, QComboBox\n)\nfrom PyQt6.QtCore import Qt, QUrl, pyqtSignal, QThread, QTimer, QProcess, QPointF\nfrom PyQt6.QtGui import QFont, QKeySequence, QShortcut, QPixmap, QIcon\n\ntry:\n    import pychromecast\n    HAS_CHROMECAST = True\nexcept ImportError:\n    HAS_CHROMECAST = False\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  ESTILO VR46 EDITION (Pure Black #000000 + Fluorescent Neon #E3FF00)\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSTYLE_VR46 = \"\"\"\nQMainWindow, QWidget {\n    background-color: #000000;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n}\n\n/* ── HEADER NEÓN VR46 ── */\n#TopHeader {\n    background-color: #000000;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #E3FF00;\n    min-height: 52px;\n    max-height: 52px;\n    padding: 0 16px;\n}\n#BrandText {\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n#BrandHighlight {\n    color: #E3FF00;\n}\n#SearchInput {\n    background-color: #0A0A0A;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    border: 1px solid #222222;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 6px 18px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    min-width: 290px;\n}\n#SearchInput:focus {\n    border: 1px solid #E3FF00;\n    background-color: #0F0F0F;\n}\n\n/* ── BOTONES DE ACCIÓN PRINCIPAL ── */\n#BtnCastHeader {\n    background-color: #E3FF00;\n    color: #000000;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    padding: 7px 18px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    border: none;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}\n#BtnCastHeader:hover {\n    background-color: #F0FF4D;\n}\n#IconBtn {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: #E3FF00;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    border: 1px solid #222222;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    min-width: 38px;\n}\n#IconBtn:hover {\n    background: #111111;\n    border-color: #E3FF00;\n}\n\n/* ── BARRA LATERAL (DRAWER) ── */\n#SidebarPanel {\n    background-color: #000000;\n    border-right: 1px solid #1A1A1A;\n    min-width: 210px;\n    max-width: 220px;\n}\n#NavBtn {\n    color: #E3FF00;\n    background: transparent;\n    text-align: left;\n    padding: 11px 18px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    margin: 2px 8px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n}\n#NavBtn:hover {\n    background-color: #111111;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n}\n#NavBtn:checked {\n    background-color: #E3FF00;\n    color: #000000;\n    font-weight: 900;\n}\n\n/* ── CHIPS DE FILTRO RÁPIDO ── */\n#FilterChip {\n    background-color: #0A0A0A;\n    color: #888888;\n    border: 1px solid #222222;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 5px 14px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n}\n#FilterChip:hover {\n    color: #E3FF00;\n    border-color: #444444;\n}\n#FilterChip:checked {\n    background-color: #E3FF00;\n    color: #000000;\n    border-color: #E3FF00;\n    font-weight: 900;\n}\n\n/* ── LISTA DE CANALES ── */\nQListWidget {\n    background-color: #050505;\n    color: #DDDDDD;\n    border: 1px solid #1A1A1A;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    outline: none;\n}\nQListWidget::item {\n    padding: 9px 12px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #111111;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    margin: 1px 4px;\n}\nQListWidget::item:selected {\n    background-color: #141414;\n    color: #E3FF00;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    border-left: 4px solid #E3FF00;\n}\nQListWidget::item:hover {\n    background-color: #0D0D0D;\n}\n\n/* ── CONTROLES INFERIORES ── */\n#BottomDock {\n    background-color: #000000;\n    border-top: 1px solid #1A1A1A;\n    min-height: 56px;\n    max-height: 56px;\n    padding: 0 16px;\n}\n#CtlBtn {\n    background-color: #0D0D0D;\n    color: #E3FF00;\n    border: 1px solid #222222;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 6px 12px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    min-width: 44px;\n}\n#CtlBtn:hover {\n    background-color: #1A1A1A;\n    border-color: #E3FF00;\n}\n#BtnActionNeon {\n    background-color: #E3FF00;\n    color: #000000;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 8px 16px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n}\n#BtnActionNeon:hover {\n    background-color: #F0FF4D;\n}\n#BtnActionDark {\n    background-color: #0D0D0D;\n    color: #E3FF00;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    border: 1px solid #2A2A2A;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 8px 14px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n}\n#BtnActionDark:hover {\n    border-color: #E3FF00;\n    background-color: #141414;\n}\n\nQSlider::groove:horizontal {\n    height: 4px;\n    background: #222222;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n}\nQSlider::handle:horizontal {\n    background: #E3FF00;\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 14px;\n    margin: -5px 0;\n    border-radius: 7px;\n}\nQSlider::sub-page:horizontal {\n    background: #E3FF00;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n}\n\n#CardItem {\n    background-color: #070707;\n    border: 1px solid #1A1A1A;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 16px;\n}\n\"\"\"\n\ndef get_local_ip() -> str:\n    try:\n        s = socket.socket(socket.AF_INET, socket.SOCK_DGRAM)\n        s.connect((\"8.8.8.8\", 80))\n        ip = s.getsockname()[0]\n        s.close()\n        return ip\n    except Exception:\n        return \"127.0.0.1\"\n\nUA_IPTV = \"IPTVSmartersPro\"\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  BROADCAST HUB — MONOCANAL CONTINUO & CONTROL REMOTO API\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nclass BroadcastHub:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.lock = threading.Lock()\n        self.current_url: str | None = None\n        self.channel_name: str = \"Sin canal\"\n        self.clients: set[queue.Queue] = set()\n        self.worker_thread: threading.Thread | None = None\n        self.stop_event = threading.Event()\n        self.raw_playlist: str = \"\"\n        self.app_window = None  # Referencia para controlar desde la Web Remote\n\n    def register_client(self) -> queue.Queue:\n        q = queue.Queue(maxsize=120)\n        with self.lock:\n            self.clients.add(q)\n        return q\n\n    def unregister_client(self, q: queue.Queue):\n        with self.lock:\n            self.clients.discard(q)\n\n    def set_channel(self, url: str, name: str = \"\"):\n        with self.lock:\n            if self.current_url == url and self.worker_thread and self.worker_thread.is_alive():\n                return\n            self.current_url = url\n            self.channel_name = name or \"Canal IPTV\"\n            self.stop_event.set()\n\n        if self.worker_thread and self.worker_thread.is_alive():\n            self.worker_thread.join(timeout=0.6)\n\n        self.stop_event.clear()\n        self.worker_thread = threading.Thread(target=self._upstream_worker, args=(url,), daemon=True)\n        self.worker_thread.start()\n\n    def _upstream_worker(self, url: str):\n        headers = {\"User-Agent\": UA_IPTV, \"Accept\": \"*/*\", \"Connection\": \"keep-alive\"}\n        backoff = 1.0\n        while not self.stop_event.is_set():\n            try:\n                req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=headers)\n                with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=12) as resp:\n                    backoff = 1.0\n                    while not self.stop_event.is_set():\n                        chunk = resp.read(32768)\n                        if not chunk:\n                            break\n                        with self.lock:\n                            dead = []\n                            for q in list(self.clients):\n                                try:\n                                    if q.full():\n                                        try: q.get_nowait()\n                                        except Exception: pass\n                                    q.put_nowait(chunk)\n                                except Exception:\n                                    dead.append(q)\n                            for d in dead:\n                                self.clients.discard(d)\n            except Exception:\n                time.sleep(backoff)\n                backoff = min(backoff * 1.5, 4.0)\n\nHUB = BroadcastHub()\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  SERVIDOR RELAY HTTP + WEB REMOTE MÓVIL (Puerto 8765)\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nclass RelayHTTPHandler(BaseHTTPRequestHandler):\n    def do_GET(self):\n        p = self.path\n        if p == \"/stream\":\n            self._serve_stream()\n        elif p == \"/playlist.m3u\":\n            self._serve_playlist()\n        elif p.startswith(\"/remote\") or p == \"/\":\n            self._serve_web_remote()\n        elif p.startswith(\"/api/cmd?\"):\n            self._handle_remote_cmd(p)\n        else:\n            self.send_error(404)\n\n    def _serve_web_remote(self):\n        \"\"\"Mando a distancia táctil para el móvil.\"\"\"\n        ip = get_local_ip()\n        ch = HUB.channel_name\n        html = f\"\"\"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no\">\n  <title>SLOCAST Remote</title>\n  <style>\n    * {{ box-sizing: border-box; touch-action: manipulation; }}\n    body {{ background: #000; color: #FFF; font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; text-align: center; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }}\n    h1 {{ color: #E3FF00; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 900; margin: 10px 0 4px 0; letter-spacing: 1px; }}\n    .subtitle {{ color: #888; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 20px; }}\n    .card {{ background: #0A0A0A; border: 1px solid #222; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; }}\n    .channel-title {{ color: #E3FF00; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; word-break: break-word; }}\n    .grid {{ display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin: 16px 0; }}\n    .btn {{ background: #141414; color: #E3FF00; border: 2px solid #222; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; }}\n    .btn:active {{ background: #E3FF00; color: #000; }}\n    .btn-main {{ background: #E3FF00; color: #000; grid-column: span 2; font-size: 18px; border: none; }}\n    .btn-main:active {{ background: #FFF; }}\n    .cast-btn {{ background: #00E676; color: #000; grid-column: span 2; font-size: 16px; border: none; }}\n    .status {{ color: #666; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 15px; }}\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <h1>👑 SLOCAST<span style=\"color:#FFF\">.pro</span></h1>\n  <div class=\"subtitle\">Mando a Distancia Móvil VR46</div>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div style=\"color:#666; font-size: 11px; text-transform:uppercase;\">Canal en Emisión</div>\n    <div class=\"channel-title\" id=\"cur_ch\">{ch}</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn-main\" onclick=\"send('toggle')\">⏯ Play / Pausa</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"send('prev')\">⏮ Canal Anterior</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"send('next')\">⏭ Siguiente Canal</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"send('vol_up')\">🔊 Subir Volumen</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"send('vol_down')\">🔉 Bajar Volumen</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"send('mute')\">🔇 Silenciar</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"send('fullscreen')\">⛶ Pantalla Completa</button>\n    <button class=\"btn cast-btn\" onclick=\"send('cast_tv')\">📺 Proyectar en Xiaomi TV</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"status\">Conectado a ThinkPad X390 ({ip}:8765)</div>\n  <script>\n    function send(action) {{\n      fetch('/api/cmd?action=' + action)\n        .then(r => r.json())\n        .then(d => {{ if(d.channel) document.getElementById('cur_ch').innerText = d.channel; }});\n    }}\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\"\"\"\n        self.send_response(200)\n        self.send_header(\"Content-Type\", \"text/html; charset=utf-8\")\n        self.end_headers()\n        self.wfile.write(html.encode())\n\n    def _handle_remote_cmd(self, path: str):\n        \"\"\"API de control remoto recibida desde el teléfono móvil.\"\"\"\n        params = urllib.parse.parse_qs(path.split(\"?\", 1)[1]) if \"?\" in path else {}\n        action = params.get(\"action\", [\"\"])[0]\n\n        win = HUB.app_window\n        if win:\n            if action == \"toggle\": win._toggle_playback()\n            elif action == \"next\": win._next_channel()\n            elif action == \"prev\": win._prev_channel()\n            elif action == \"vol_up\": win.slider_vol.setValue(min(100, win.slider_vol.value() + 8))\n            elif action == \"vol_down\": win.slider_vol.setValue(max(0, win.slider_vol.value() - 8))\n            elif action == \"mute\": win._toggle_mute()\n            elif action == \"fullscreen\": win._toggle_fullscreen()\n            elif action == \"cast_tv\": win._cast_to_xiaomi_tv()\n\n        resp = f'{{\"status\":\"ok\",\"channel\":\"{HUB.channel_name}\"}}'\n        self.send_response(200)\n        self.send_header(\"Content-Type\", \"application/json\")\n        self.send_header(\"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\", \"*\")\n        self.end_headers()\n        self.wfile.write(resp.encode())\n\n    def _serve_playlist(self):\n        content = HUB.raw_playlist\n        if not content:\n            self.send_error(404)\n            return\n        data = content.encode(\"utf-8\")\n        self.send_response(200)\n        self.send_header(\"Content-Type\", \"application/vnd.apple.mpegurl\")\n        self.send_header(\"Content-Length\", str(len(data)))\n        self.send_header(\"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\", \"*\")\n        self.end_headers()\n        self.wfile.write(data)\n\n    def _serve_stream(self):\n        if not HUB.current_url:\n            self.send_error(503, \"Sin canal seleccionado\")\n            return\n        cq = HUB.register_client()\n        try:\n            self.send_response(200)\n            self.send_header(\"Content-Type\", \"video/mp2t\")\n            self.send_header(\"Cache-Control\", \"no-cache\")\n            self.send_header(\"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\", \"*\")\n            self.end_headers()\n            while not HUB.stop_event.is_set():\n                try:\n                    chunk = cq.get(timeout=2.0)\n                    self.wfile.write(chunk)\n                except queue.Empty:\n                    if not (HUB.worker_thread and HUB.worker_thread.is_alive()):\n                        break\n                    continue\n        except (BrokenPipeError, ConnectionResetError):\n            pass\n        finally:\n            HUB.unregister_client(cq)\n\n    def log_message(self, *args): pass\n\n\nclass RelayServer:\n    PORT = 8765\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._srv: ThreadingHTTPServer | None = None\n        self.is_running = False\n\n    def start(self) -> bool:\n        if self.is_running: return True\n        try:\n            self._srv = ThreadingHTTPServer((\"0.0.0.0\", self.PORT), RelayHTTPHandler)\n            threading.Thread(target=self._srv.serve_forever, daemon=True).start()\n            self.is_running = True\n            return True\n        except OSError:\n            return False\n\n    def stop(self):\n        if self._srv:\n            self._srv.shutdown()\n            self.is_running = False\n\n    @property\n    def stream_url(self) -> str:\n        return f\"http://{get_local_ip()}:{self.PORT}/stream\"\n\n    @property\n    def loopback_url(self) -> str:\n        return f\"http://127.0.0.1:{self.PORT}/stream\"\n\n    @property\n    def remote_url(self) -> str:\n        return f\"http://{get_local_ip()}:{self.PORT}/remote\"\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  CONTROLADOR XIAOMI TV (SLÖNE)\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nclass XiaomiCastController(QThread):\n    cast_status = pyqtSignal(str, bool)\n\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.cast_device = None\n        self.is_connected = False\n        self._target_url = \"\"\n        self._target_title = \"\"\n        self._action = \"idle\"\n\n    def connect_and_play(self, url: str, title: str):\n        self._target_url = url\n        self._target_title = title\n        self._action = \"play\"\n        if not self.isRunning():\n            self.start()\n\n    def stop_cast(self):\n        self._action = \"stop\"\n        if not self.isRunning():\n            self.start()\n\n    def run(self):\n        if not HAS_CHROMECAST:\n            self.cast_status.emit(\"pychromecast no disponible\", False)\n            return\n        try:\n            if self._action == \"play\":\n                self.cast_status.emit(\"Conectando con Xiaomi TV (SLÖNE)...\", False)\n                casts, browser = pychromecast.get_listed_chromecasts(friendly_names=[\"SLÖNE\"])\n                if not casts:\n                    chromecasts, browser = pychromecast.get_chromecasts()\n                    casts = [c for c in chromecasts if \"xiaomi\" in c.model_name.lower() or \"mitv\" in c.model_name.lower()]\n\n                if not casts:\n                    self.cast_status.emit(\"Xiaomi TV no detectada\", False)\n                    pychromecast.discovery.stop_discovery(browser)\n                    return\n\n                cast = casts[0]\n                cast.wait()\n                mc = cast.media_controller\n                mc.play_media(self._target_url, \"video/mp2t\", title=f\"SLOCAST: {self._target_title}\")\n                mc.block_until_active(timeout=5)\n                self.cast_device = cast\n                self.is_connected = True\n                self.cast_status.emit(f\"Transmitiendo en Xiaomi TV: {self._target_title}\", True)\n                pychromecast.discovery.stop_discovery(browser)\n            elif self._action == \"stop\":\n                if self.cast_device:\n                    try: self.cast_device.media_controller.stop()\n                    except Exception: pass\n                self.is_connected = False\n                self.cast_status.emit(\"Transmisión en TV detenida\", False)\n        except Exception as e:\n            self.cast_status.emit(f\"Error Cast: {str(e)[:30]}\", False)\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  REPRODUCTOR MPV PRO (Timeshift + Multi-Audio + Yadif 50 FPS)\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nclass MPVWidget(QWidget):\n    double_clicked = pyqtSignal()\n\n    def __init__(self, parent=None):\n        super().__init__(parent)\n        self.setObjectName(\"VideoViewport\")\n        self.setMinimumSize(460, 300)\n        self._proc: QProcess | None = None\n        self._vol = 80\n        self._muted = False\n\n        lay = QVBoxLayout(self)\n        lay.setContentsMargins(0, 0, 0, 0)\n        self.placeholder = QLabel(\"👑  SLOCAST PRO PLAYER\\n\\nSelecciona un canal para reproducir\\n[Espacio: Pausa | A: Cambiar Audio | F: Pantalla Completa]\", self)\n        self.placeholder.setAlignment(Qt.AlignmentFlag.AlignCenter)\n        self.placeholder.setStyleSheet(\"color: #E3FF00; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; background: #000000;\")\n        lay.addWidget(self.placeholder)\n\n    def mouseDoubleClickEvent(self, event):\n        self.double_clicked.emit()\n        super().mouseDoubleClickEvent(event)\n\n    def play(self, stream_url: str):\n        self.stop()\n        self.placeholder.hide()\n        wid = str(int(self.winId()))\n        args = [\n            f\"--wid={wid}\",\n            \"--no-terminal\",\n            \"--no-input-default-bindings\",\n            \"--cache=yes\",\n            \"--demuxer-max-bytes=256M\",       # Búfer Timeshift para rebobinar\n            \"--demuxer-max-back-bytes=128M\",  # 128MB de memoria hacia atrás\n            \"--hr-seek=yes\",\n            \"--deinterlace=auto\",             # Desentrelazado Yadif deportivo\n            f\"--volume={self._vol}\",\n            \"--mute=no\" if not self._muted else \"--mute=yes\",\n            f\"--user-agent={UA_IPTV}\",\n            \"--no-sub\",\n            stream_url\n        ]\n        self._proc = QProcess(self)\n        self._proc.finished.connect(lambda: self.placeholder.show())\n        self._proc.start(\"mpv\", args)\n\n    def stop(self):\n        if self._proc:\n            self._proc.write(b\"quit\\n\")\n            self._proc.waitForFinished(300)\n            self._proc.kill()\n            self._proc = None\n        self.placeholder.show()\n\n    def toggle_pause(self):\n        if self._proc and self._proc.state() == QProcess.ProcessState.Running:\n            self._proc.write(b\"cycle pause\\n\")\n\n    def cycle_audio(self):\n        \"\"\"Alternar pista de audio (Cadena SER, COPE, Audio TV oficial).\"\"\"\n        if self._proc and self._proc.state() == QProcess.ProcessState.Running:\n            self._proc.write(b\"cycle audio\\n\")\n\n    def cycle_subtitles(self):\n        if self._proc and self._proc.state() == QProcess.ProcessState.Running:\n            self._proc.write(b\"cycle sub\\n\")\n\n    def seek_relative(self, seconds: int):\n        \"\"\"Timeshift: Avanzar o retroceder segundos en el búfer local.\"\"\"\n        if self._proc and self._proc.state() == QProcess.ProcessState.Running:\n            self._proc.write(f\"seek {seconds} relative\\n\".encode())\n\n    def set_volume(self, val: int):\n        self._vol = val\n        if self._proc and self._proc.state() == QProcess.ProcessState.Running:\n            self._proc.write(f\"set volume {val}\\n\".encode())\n\n    def toggle_mute(self):\n        self._muted = not self._muted\n        if self._proc and self._proc.state() == QProcess.ProcessState.Running:\n            self._proc.write(b\"cycle mute\\n\")\n        return self._muted\n\n    def is_playing(self) -> bool:\n        return self._proc is not None and self._proc.state() == QProcess.ProcessState.Running\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  CARGADOR ASÍNCRONO M3U CON INDEXACIÓN INTELIGENTE\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nclass M3ULoaderThread(QThread):\n    channels_ready = pyqtSignal(list, dict, str)\n\n    def __init__(self, source: str):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.source = source\n\n    def run(self):\n        try:\n            content = Path(self.source).read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"ignore\")\n            channels = []\n            categories = {}\n            cur_name = \"Canal\"\n            cur_group = \"Otros\"\n\n            for line in content.splitlines():\n                line = line.strip()\n                if line.startswith(\"#EXTINF:\"):\n                    parts = line.split(\",\", 1)\n                    cur_name = parts[1].strip() if len(parts) > 1 else \"Canal\"\n                    cur_group = \"Otros\"\n                    if 'group-title=\"' in line:\n                        try:\n                            g = line.split('group-title=\"')[1].split('\"')[0].strip()\n                            if g: cur_group = g\n                        except IndexError: pass\n                elif line and not line.startswith(\"#\"):\n                    item = {\"name\": cur_name, \"url\": line, \"group\": cur_group}\n                    channels.append(item)\n                    if cur_group not in categories:\n                        categories[cur_group] = []\n                    categories[cur_group].append(item)\n                    cur_name = \"Canal\"\n                    cur_group = \"Otros\"\n\n            self.channels_ready.emit(channels, categories, content)\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n#  VENTANA PRINCIPAL SLOCAST APEX VR46\n# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nclass SLOCastMainWindow(QMainWindow):\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.setWindowTitle(\"SLOCAST APEX PRO — VR46 Edition\")\n        self.resize(1340, 840)\n        self.setMinimumSize(960, 620)\n        self.setStyleSheet(STYLE_VR46)\n\n        # Cargar icono oficial si existe\n        icon_path = Path(\"/home/slone/.local/share/icons/slocast.png\")\n        if icon_path.exists():\n            self.setWindowIcon(QIcon(str(icon_path)))\n\n        self.all_channels: list = []\n        self.categories_index: dict = {}\n        self.recent_channels: list = []\n        self.bookmarked_channels: list = []\n        self.current_channel: dict | None = None\n        self.active_category: str = \"🇪🇸 España\"\n\n        # Hub & Relay\n        self.relay = RelayServer()\n        self.relay.start()\n        HUB.app_window = self  # Permitir control desde la Web Remote del móvil\n\n        # Controlador Xiaomi TV\n        self.cast_ctl = XiaomiCastController()\n        self.cast_ctl.cast_status.connect(self._on_cast_status)\n\n        # Reproductor MPV\n        self.mpv = MPVWidget(self)\n        self.mpv.double_clicked.connect(self._toggle_fullscreen)\n\n        # Temporizador de búsqueda con debounce\n        self.search_timer = QTimer(self)\n        self.search_timer.setSingleShot(True)\n        self.search_timer.timeout.connect(self._execute_search)\n\n        self._build_ui()\n        self._setup_shortcuts()\n        self._check_autoload()\n\n    def _build_ui(self):\n        root = QWidget()\n        self.setCentralWidget(root)\n        vl = QVBoxLayout(root)\n        vl.setContentsMargins(0, 0, 0, 0)\n        vl.setSpacing(0)\n\n        # 1. Header superior VR46\n        vl.addWidget(self._build_top_header())\n\n        # 2. Cuerpo: Menú lateral + Stack\n        body = QWidget()\n        hl = QHBoxLayout(body)\n        hl.setContentsMargins(0, 0, 0, 0)\n        hl.setSpacing(0)\n\n        self.stack = QStackedWidget()\n        self.stack.addWidget(self._page_channels())    # 0: Canales IPTV\n        self.stack.addWidget(self._page_favorites())   # 1: Favoritos\n        self.stack.addWidget(self._page_recents())     # 2: Recientes\n        self.stack.addWidget(self._page_remote())      # 3: Mando Web Móvil\n        self.stack.addWidget(self._page_cast())        # 4: Transmitir a TV\n        self.stack.addWidget(self._page_files())       # 5: Vídeo Local\n        self.stack.addWidget(self._page_settings())    # 6: Ajustes de Pago (Gratis)\n\n        hl.addWidget(self._build_sidebar())\n        hl.addWidget(self.stack, 1)\n        vl.addWidget(body, 1)\n\n        # 3. Barra inferior de control\n        vl.addWidget(self._build_bottom_dock())\n\n    # ── HEADER SUPERIOR ───────────────────────────────────────────\n    def _build_top_header(self) -> QWidget:\n        h = QWidget()\n        h.setObjectName(\"TopHeader\")\n        hl = QHBoxLayout(h)\n        hl.setContentsMargins(10, 0, 10, 0)\n        hl.setSpacing(12)\n\n        brand = QLabel(\"👑 SLOCAST<span style='color:#E3FF00'>.APEX</span>\")\n        brand.setObjectName(\"BrandText\")\n        brand.setTextFormat(Qt.TextFormat.RichText)\n\n        self.search_input = QLineEdit()\n        self.search_input.setObjectName(\"SearchInput\")\n        self.search_input.setPlaceholderText(\"🔍  Buscar canales, deportes, cine...\")\n        self.search_input.textChanged.connect(lambda: self.search_timer.start(250))\n\n        self.btn_top_cast = QPushButton(\"📡  Transmitir a Xiaomi TV (SLÖNE)\")\n        self.btn_top_cast.setObjectName(\"BtnCastHeader\")\n        self.btn_top_cast.clicked.connect(self._cast_to_xiaomi_tv)\n\n        btn_fs = QPushButton(\"⛶\")\n        btn_fs.setObjectName(\"IconBtn\")\n        btn_fs.setToolTip(\"Pantalla Completa [F]\")\n        btn_fs.clicked.connect(self._toggle_fullscreen)\n\n        hl.addWidget(brand)\n        hl.addStretch()\n        hl.addWidget(self.search_input)\n        hl.addWidget(self.btn_top_cast)\n        hl.addWidget(btn_fs)\n        return h\n\n    # ── MENÚ LATERAL (DRAWER) ─────────────────────────────────────\n    def _build_sidebar(self) -> QWidget:\n        sb = QWidget()\n        sb.setObjectName(\"SidebarPanel\")\n        vl = QVBoxLayout(sb)\n        vl.setContentsMargins(6, 14, 6, 14)\n        vl.setSpacing(3)\n\n        self.nav_group = QButtonGroup(self)\n        self.nav_group.setExclusive(True)\n\n        items = [\n            (\"📺  Canales IPTV\", 0),\n            (\"★  Favoritos\", 1),\n            (\"🕒  Recientes\", 2),\n            (\"📱  Mando en Móvil\", 3),\n            (\"📡  Transmitir a TV\", 4),\n            (\"📁  Vídeo Local\", 5),\n            (\"⚙  Ajustes Pro\", 6),\n        ]\n\n        for text, page_idx in items:\n            btn = QPushButton(text)\n            btn.setObjectName(\"NavBtn\")\n            btn.setCheckable(True)\n            if page_idx == 0:\n                